# Kipuka EST — Certificate Renewal (RFC 7030 §4.3)
Output docs/gifs/08-est-reenroll.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# EST Certificate Renewal — kipuka-rsa.cert-lab.local (RFC 7030 §4.3)"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "./lab est-reenroll -p rsa"
Enter
Sleep 5s
